                            {
                                "target_word": "Columbus",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92d9a968-c3ae-339b-bdef-2dc531ea3ce7",
                                        "entry_id": "f1049830-d348-3ca9-9752-949585f7cb83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who makes a great discovery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0f3fb7b-1f2c-4ac3-8776-dd325c66f5d8",
                                                "sense_id": "92d9a968-c3ae-339b-bdef-2dc531ea3ce7",
                                                "text": "\"It is colossal. You are a Columbus of science who has discovered a lost world.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Columbus",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c9854dd-6a7e-3e1e-bbfa-a7c926d619ff",
                                        "entry_id": "16de74fb-cea5-3355-9bf9-64c8abe1357c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To explore; to go around exploring, to go around as an explorer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "possibly",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fea50acb-c45f-40bc-8f9d-d3ff0f9b9990",
                                                "sense_id": "4c9854dd-6a7e-3e1e-bbfa-a7c926d619ff",
                                                "text": "\"But, boy the powers of mud, I belayve you fellers mane to make an indepindint cruise in the Orient, and go Columbusing all over the ocean boy the way ye's talk!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e702ee89-181f-4c0e-98ea-378da1ac6182",
                                                "sense_id": "4c9854dd-6a7e-3e1e-bbfa-a7c926d619ff",
                                                "text": "Callous as the old mummy was about anything and everything save his pet hobby, archaeology, he would sit up and take notice of such a vision ; and Peter felt that, having Columbused the discovery, he had the better right to it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69c6b365-95cf-4d00-b990-14bbb237b0da",
                                                "sense_id": "4c9854dd-6a7e-3e1e-bbfa-a7c926d619ff",
                                                "text": "To the west of the river lay the country in which I went Columbusing — the enchanted desert whose southern boundary was where the sky reached down and merged with the earth curve, and whose northern limit was the Harqua Hala range […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dffad0fa-f0b6-4a93-a6c0-baece50ac6ad",
                                                "sense_id": "4c9854dd-6a7e-3e1e-bbfa-a7c926d619ff",
                                                "text": "No street car line passes it, so you'll have to do a little Columbusing on your own account-to find it-—but it's worth discovering, and President Gardner's phophecy sounds conservative."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50b50a75-5359-34e1-a2ff-fb4f2e483c3e",
                                        "entry_id": "16de74fb-cea5-3355-9bf9-64c8abe1357c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To appropriate; to lay claim to something, especially a discovery, which is perceived as belonging to someone else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "beb49a6c-46bb-49f0-b701-e716c6d5cc8b",
                                                "sense_id": "50b50a75-5359-34e1-a2ff-fb4f2e483c3e",
                                                "text": "When his black friend tells him that many people knew about the bar before he did, his white friend retorts by saying that he “Columbused it”; i.e., discovered it for white people before a gaggle of hip white people flooded in."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3964b4da-0aba-4442-9d65-c547cf1d1137",
                                                "sense_id": "50b50a75-5359-34e1-a2ff-fb4f2e483c3e",
                                                "text": "Of course, there is no bouncer, but we can be careful not to Columbus other culture's traditions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb10246b-89fd-4f07-b4b9-6ca36bb1cbad",
                                                "sense_id": "50b50a75-5359-34e1-a2ff-fb4f2e483c3e",
                                                "text": "He then lists other things that have been Columbused, such as twerking by Miley Cyrus and hummus by “health conscious whities.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
